# godi is a library — it has no server, no BASE_URL, and no external API, so the
# usual web-test environment variables (TEST_ENV / BASE_URL / API_URL) do not
# apply. This file is kept as a placeholder so contributors know there is
# nothing to configure to run the suite.
#
# The test suite is driven by `go test` flags, not environment variables:
#
#   -update-golden   rewrite testdata/*.golden fixtures (generator emission tests)
#   -race            enable the race detector  (Makefile `test` sets this)
#   -short           skip slow cases           (Makefile `test-short`)
#
# Add a variable here only if a future test genuinely needs one.
